<title>USA: Pitney Bowes names chief technology officer.</title>
<headline>Pitney Bowes names chief technology officer.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pitney Bowes Inc said on Friday it has named Joseph Wall vice president-chief technology officer, a newly created position.</p>
<p>Wall will report directly to Michael J. Critelli, vice chairman and chief executive officer of Pitney Bowes Inc.</p>
<p>Wall was most recently the vice president-technology of Emerson Electric Co, Pitney Bowes said.</p>
